+      "origin": "New teaching material prepared under the owner's 15 October 2026 authorisation to use internet equivalents; not recovered school-source text. It supersedes, in delivery, the original Second-Term row 'Puberty.', which contains a garbled hormone sentence, lists 'constant erection' and a 'high-pitch tiny voice' as puberty changes, and gives no guidance on where to get help. The original row is preserved unchanged in the audit record. It is school teaching, not personal medical advice.",
