+      "origin": "New teaching material prepared under the owner's 15 October 2026 authorisation to use internet equivalents; not recovered school-source text. It supersedes, in delivery, the original First-Term row 'FAMILY LIFE EDUCATION [i]', whose myth-and-fact list states that pregnancy may last more than a year, treats first-time sex as unable to cause pregnancy, and contains unclear items. The original row is preserved unchanged in the audit record. It is school teaching, not personal medical advice; the separate row 'FAMILY LIFE EDUCATION [ii]' on abortion is retained.",
